This file is a summary. The full license texts are distributed with MIB under
`mib/licenses/`:

  mib/licenses/README                    - overview and links to the online versions
  mib/licenses/LICENSE_MIB_for_MATLAB    - GNU GPL v3, applies to the MIB source code
  mib/licenses/LICENSE_MIB_Standalone    - terms for the compiled standalone application
  mib/licenses/MATLAB_license.txt        - MathWorks, Inc. Software License Agreement
  mib/licenses/MATLAB_MCR_license.txt    - MATLAB Runtime (MCR) license

Licenses of the third-party packages bundled with MIB are stored next to those
packages in `mib/external/` (individual `*_license.txt` files and per-package
license files inside each package directory).


