Compiled standalone MIB (Windows, macOS, Linux)
-----------------------------------------------

The deployed binaries are built with MATLAB Compiler and ship with the MATLAB
Runtime. By using the standalone version you accept, in addition to the GPL v3
terms above:

  - the MATLAB Runtime (MCR) license, which permits installing and using the
    Runtime solely to run compiled applications such as MIB, and forbids
    modifying, reverse engineering or redistributing the Runtime on its own;
  - the applicable parts of the MathWorks, Inc. Software License Agreement;
  - NO COMMERCIAL USE: the standalone version is compiled under an Academic
    MATLAB license, therefore using these binaries for commercial purposes is
    prohibited. This restriction comes from the build toolchain, not from MIB;
    the source code itself remains GPL v3 and carries no such limitation.

The standalone version is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

Full text: mib/licenses/LICENSE_MIB_Standalone
Online:    https://mib.helsinki.fi/license_standalone.html


